{"quest_id": 4262, "name": "襲われた住民", "description": "住民たちが忍者に襲われているとの\n報告を受け、王子は助けに向かう。\n\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "妖怪大戦", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920040, "map_no": 3555, "level": 90, "multiplier": 0.9, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 600, "drops": [{"item": 5002, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 576, "attack": 126, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 135, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 34}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 810, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 30, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 57, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098800, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 17, "missile": {"speed": 5.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 122, "global_id": 121, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 67}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、住民たちが忍者に襲われたとの\n報告があった場所です。", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、敵がこちらに向かってきています。\n住民たちを守るため、反撃いたしましょう！", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "イナリ", "text": "忍者たちを追い払うとは、なかなかの腕前だねー。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "あんたたちなら妖怪の総大将の復活を\n阻止できるかもね。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "妖怪の総大将……ですか？", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "そうそう。このまま復活したら\n多くの人間が襲われるんじゃないかな。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "なぜそこまでの事情を知っているのですか？\nあなたはいったい……？", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "同じ妖怪だからね！\nあたし、妖狐のイナリって名前なの。\n妖怪って聞いたことくらいはない？", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "妖怪は確かに聞いたことはありますが……。\nなぜその同じ妖怪が私たちに警告を？", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "んー、あたしって人間を驚かすのが楽しいんだよね。\nむしろそれが生きがいっていうのかな。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "だけど、妖怪の総大将が復活しちゃったら\n多くの人間たちが犠牲になる。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "イナリ", "text": "驚かせる人間がいなくなっちゃったら\n私は何を生きがいにしたらいいの？\nって訳であんたたちに協力してあげるの。", "face": "u243"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "な…なるほど……。理由はともかく、\nこのまま放っておいていい問題でもありませんね。\n王子、詳しい話はお城で聞かせてもらいましょう。", "face": "l3ce37df4acc6"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920040_3555", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 30, "y": 437}, {"k": "m", "x": 158, "y": 187, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 270, "y": 198, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 403, "y": 211, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 475, "y": 186, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 561, "y": 122, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 648, "y": 88, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 463, "y": 285, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 239, "y": 392, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 348, "y": 384, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 448, "y": 360, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 546, "y": 308, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 655, "y": 265, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 751, "y": 246, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 114, "y": 390, "id": 213}, {"k": "r", "x": 589, "y": 48, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 393, "y": 146, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 175, "y": 129, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 129, "y": 243, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 571, "y": 177, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 545, "y": 230, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 436, "y": 432, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 293, "y": 456, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 165, "y": 445, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 784, "y": 312, "id": 309}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "Attacked Residents", "description_en": "Receiving reports that the villagers are being attacked by ninjas,\nthe Prince rushes to rescue them.\n\nBeginner (★1 target: average Lv1, 5 enemies)"}